            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.32.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lundi omwami Yosia onakaka Tofeti, abuundu e khukhwisaaya bifwaani a aaba mwitooma lie basoleeli ba Hinomu. Akhola ario nio omundu yesi yesi akhakhola ario osia omusoleeli wewe namwe omukhaana wewe nga siianwa khu wele Moleki tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi Yosia arusia chifarasi nicho babaami ba Yuda baba ne bara alubeka khulwe enyanga mala osia kamakaari ke liie kakakholanga kimilimo kie khusaaya khuno. (Bino biaba biabiikhwa siimbi e silibwa ne bumenyo bwa Nasani Meleki omunamae omukhulu.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bab. 21.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 33.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akhweesa arusia chialutare chichaba mu lusiro lwe ekorofa eya Ahasi. Chialutare echo chakholwa ne babaami ba Yuda. Omwami Yosia atechula alala ne chialutare nicho omwami Manase akhola mu mbya chibili che enju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, acharamo bitonyi bibili mala achimwaata mu litooma lia Kiduroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 11.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yosia onakaka abuundu aesuta niio omwami Solomoni aba ne akhola ebukwe owa Yerusalemu, khulwe khusaaya. Ashitoreti wele owe Basidonia, Chemoshi wele owe Bamoabu ne Moleki wele owe Baamoni. Abuundu ao aba ebunafubo we sikulu sia Miseituni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Yosia atechula chinjeko mu bitonyi. Aremakakamo wele Asherimu mala abuundu niio biabechanga echusiao kamakuumba ke babaandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
