          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 12.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lundi, Yosia atechula alutare eye e Beteli, abuundu aesuta aarebwao ne Yeroboamu okhwa Nebati, owarangirira Isiraeli mu khukhola bumayaanu. Yosia akwiisia alutare eyo ne abuundu aesuta mala arakaka kamabaale kayo mu bitonyi mala lundi akachuunga kekela lipukhuulu. Akhaba lundi osia sifwaani sia Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yosia alola mala abonayo biliindwa khu lukulu. Arumania barusia kamakuumba kamwo mala bakosiela khu alutare. Mungila yino onakaka alutare eyo khuloondekhana ne likhuwa lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nilio omung'oosi wewe ang'oola. Owang'oola bung'oosi buno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.30+1KI.13.31+1KI.13.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 13.30-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Areeba ali, “Siliindwa esio sia naanu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
